94万亿（环比+23.5%）\n4月→5月：增速持续，达 2.24万亿（环比+15.1%）\n5月→6月：稳步攀升至 2.35万亿（环比+5.1%），增速趋稳\n态势评估：上半年Tokens消耗量整体呈先抑后扬的快速增长曲线，3月起进入加速通道，5-6月增速趋缓但绝对量维持高位，反映出中国区AI业务需求持续旺盛，Tokens消耗规模显著扩大。","variant":"insight"}},{"id":"summary-monthly-table-data","type":"table","layout":{"span":12},"data":{"main":"ds-tokens-monthly-summary"},"props":{"title":"2026年上半年中国区Tokens消耗量月度汇总","columns":[{"field":"ds-tokens-monthly-summary-field-identity-544cdc58462690bd","title":"账期","align":"left"},{"field":"ds-tokens-monthly-summary-field-identity-04259747f4b11d27","title":"Tokens消耗量","align":"right"}],"subtitle":"按账期"}},{"id":"result-scope-summary-monthly-table-data","type":"text","layout":{"span":12},"props":{"body":"数据口径：\n助手-现网-作战地图-产品地图-Tokens流水；2026-01 至 2026-06；month；按8513a4_账期；8513a4_地区部=中国地区部"}},{"id":"summary-trend-chart","type":"lineChart","layout":{"span":12},"data":{"main":"ds-tokens-monthly-summary"},"props":{"title":"Tokens消耗量月度趋势（2026年1-6月）","xField":"ds-tokens-monthly-summary-field-identity-544cdc58462690bd","series":[{"field":"ds-tokens-monthly-summary-field-identity-04259747f4b11d27","label":"Tokens消耗量"}]}}]},{"id":"overview","title":"整体概览","container":"card","components":[{"id":"trend-chart","type":"lineChart","layout":{"span":12},"data":{"main":"ds-tokens-monthly-trend"},"props":{"title":"Tokens消耗量月度趋势（2026年1-6月）","xField":"ds-tokens-monthly-trend-field-identity-544cdc58462690bd","series":[{"field":"ds-tokens-monthly-trend-field-identity-04259747f4b11d27","label":"Tokens消耗量"}]}},{"id":"overview-summary","type":"text","layout":{"span":12},"props":{"body":"2026年上半年中国区Tokens消耗量呈持续增长态势。1月消耗约1.14万亿，至6月已达2.35万亿，增长约107%。上半年累计消耗约10.28万亿Tokens，月均消耗约1.71万亿。其中6月单月消耗最高，达2.35万亿，较1月翻倍以上，反映出中国区Tokens业务需求旺盛，增长势头强劲。","title":"上半年整体情况"}},{"id":"structure-scope-overview","type":"text","layout":{"span":12},"props":{"body":"数据口径：\n助手-现网-作战地图-产品地图-Tokens流水；2026-01 至 2026-06；month；按8513a4_账期；8513a4_地区部=中国地区部"}},{"id":"overview-trend-chart-data","type":"lineChart","layout":{"span":12},"data":{"main":"ds-tok